ting, viewers in millions) - **Matches**: datetime, float (possession, temperature), decimal (revenue) - **Quotes**: float (popularity score), int (shares) - **File uploads**: POST /teams/{id}/logo for image uploads  ### Easter Eggs  - **429**: \"Too Much Negativity\" - when you need to be more positive - **403**: \"Judgment Without Curiosity\" - be curious, not judgmental - **418**: \"I'm a Believer!\" - when you believe too much (is that possible?)  ### API Versioning  This API supports header-based versioning using date format (YYYY-MM-DD). Include one of these headers in your request:  - `X-API-Version: 2026-01-20` (preferred) - `API-Version: 2026-01-20`  Response headers will include: - `X-API-Version`: The version used for the request - `X-API-Supported-Versions`: List of all supported versions  If no version header is provided, the API defaults to the latest stable version.  *\"Be curious, not judgmental.\"* - Ted Lasso     
